## Health checks

```csharp
// En Program.cs
builder.Services.AddHealthChecks()
    .AddCheck<SabreHealthCheck>("sabre", failureStatus: HealthStatus.Unhealthy, tags: new[] { "ready" })
    .AddCheck<SftpHealthCheck>("sftp", failureStatus: HealthStatus.Degraded, tags: new[] { "ready" })
    .AddDbContextCheck<AidxDbContext>("sql", failureStatus: HealthStatus.Unhealthy, tags: new[] { "ready" })
    .AddCheck<SecretsHealthCheck>("secrets", failureStatus: HealthStatus.Unhealthy, tags: new[] { "ready" });
```

El container responde a `--health-check` CLI arg · usado por Docker HEALTHCHECK + K8s livenessProbe.

## Cobertura compliance logs

| Regulación | Log requirement | Implementación |
|---|---|---|
| **SOX** (si aplica) | Audit trail de cambios data financiera | CloudWatch Logs retention 7 años · S3 archive Object Lock |
| **LFPDPPP** | PII redaction · access logs | Serilog PiiRedactor + CloudWatch Logs ACL |
| **AMX retention** | 5 años mínimo | S3 archive post 1 año · Object Lock compliance mode |

## Alarms definidas

```yaml
# CloudWatch Alarms (referencia · YAML en infra/cloudformation/alarms.yaml pendiente)
- AlarmName: {{APP_ID_SHORT}}-job-failed-2x
  MetricName: JobDuration
  Dimensions: [{Name: Outcome, Value: Failed}]
  Statistic: Sum
  Period: 86400  # 24h
  Threshold: 2
  ComparisonOperator: GreaterThanOrEqualToThreshold
  AlarmActions: [PagerDutyTopic]
  Severity: SEV-1

- AlarmName: {{APP_ID_SHORT}}-no-run-26h
  MetricName: JobDuration
  Statistic: SampleCount
  Period: 93600  # 26h
  Threshold: 1
  ComparisonOperator: LessThanThreshold
  AlarmActions: [PagerDutyTopic]
  Severity: SEV-1

- AlarmName: {{APP_ID_SHORT}}-sabre-error-rate
  MetricName: SabreApiErrors
  Statistic: Sum
  Period: 300
  Threshold: 5
  ComparisonOperator: GreaterThanThreshold
  AlarmActions: [SlackWarningTopic]
  Severity: SEV-2
```

